<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
    <style>
        {{{inlineResetStyles}}}
        {{{inlineStyles}}}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <header>
            <div class="text--right txt txt--xs">PC-G-17.0A (Rev. 8-2021)</div>
            <div class="text--center">
                <h2 class="mt-16 uppercase">PROBATE COURT OF FRANKLIN COUNTY, OHIO</h2>
                <h4 class="uppercase">JEFFREY D. MACKEY, JUDGE</h4>
            </div>
        </header>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4">
                <div class="txt txt--m uppercase w-auto">
                    <p>IN THE MATTER OF <br>THE GUARDIANSHIP OF</p>
                </div>
                <div class="input fullw">{{caseDetailsStep.guardianName}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4 mt-16">
                <div class="txt txt--m uppercase w-auto">
                    <p>CASE NO.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="input w-auto mw-200">{{caseDetailsStep.caseNumber}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text--center mt-20">
                <h2>APPLICATION FOR APPOINTMENT OF GUARDIAN <br>OF ALLEGED INCOMPETENT</h2>
                <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>[R.C.2111.03]</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-16 grid gap-30">
              <div class="flex v-center h--start gap-30">
                <div class="flex v--center h--start gap-8">
                  <div class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals caseDetailsStep.relationshipToWard "Initial appointment"}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s">Initial Appointment</div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex v--center h--start gap-8">
                  <div class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals caseDetailsStep.relationshipToWard "Successor appointment"}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s">Successor Appointment</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="row">
                <div class="flex v--start h--between gap-4">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto lh-140">
                    <p>1. Applicant represents to the court that</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text fullw">
                    <div class="input fullw">{{wardInformStep.wardName}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--xxs">Prospective Ward</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto lh-140">
                    <p>resides or has a legal</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex v--start h--between gap-4 mt-8 pl-16">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto lh-140">
                    <p>settlement at</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text fullw">
                    <div class="input fullw">{{wardInformStep.wardAddress}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto lh-140">
                    <p>in <strong>FRANKLIN</strong></p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-8 pl-16">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>County, Ohio and that the prospective ward is incompetent by reason of R.C. 2111.01 (D). Please describe</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex mt-16">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">
                      <p>Prospective Ward's incompetency:</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="input fullw"></div>
                  </div>
                  {{#if wardInformStep.explanationNeedsOfGuardian}}
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8">{{wardInformStep.explanationNeedsOfGuardian}}</div>
                  {{else}}
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                  {{/if}}
                </div>
                
                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-8 mt-16">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">2. The Prospective Ward's date of birth is:</div>
                  <div class="input fullw">{{wardInformStep.wardDob}}</div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-8 mt-16">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">3. The Applicant's date of birth is</div>
                  <div class="input fullw">{{applicantInformStep.applicantDob}}</div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-8 mt-16">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">4. Applicant's relationship to Prospective Ward is:</div>
                  <div class="input fullw">{{applicantInformStep.applicantRelationshipToWard}}</div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-8 mt-16">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">5. Does the Applicant or the Prospective Ward require an interpreter to understand English?</div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-8 mt-16 pl-4">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">
                    <p>
                      <span class="checkbox">
                      {{#or wardInformStep.isWardNeedsInterpreterForEnglish applicantInformStep.isApplicantRequiringInterpreter}}
                        ✓
                      {{/or}}
                      </span>
                      No
                      {{#or wardInformStep.isWardNeedsInterpreterForEnglish applicantInformStep.isApplicantRequiringInterpreter}}
                        
                      {{else}}
                      ✓
                      {{/or}} 
                      <span class="checkbox">{{#if wardInformStep.isWardNeedsInterpreterForEnglish}}✓{{/if}}</span>Yes; 
                    &nbsp;&nbsp; If yes, who requires an interpreter?</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="input fullw">
                    {{#if wardInformStep.isWardNeedsInterpreterForEnglish}}
                      Applicant{{#if applicantInformStep.isApplicantRequiringInterpreter}}
                      ,
                      {{/if}}
                    {{/if}}
                    {{#if applicantInformStep.isApplicantRequiringInterpreter}}
                      Prospective Ward
                    {{/if}}
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-8 mt-16 pl-16">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">What language?</div>
                  <div class="input mw-300">
                  {{#if wardInformStep.wardSpeakLanguage}}
                    {{wardInformStep.wardSpeakLanguage}}{{#if applicantInformStep.isApplicantRequiringInterpreter}}, {{/if}}
                  {{/if}}
                  {{applicantInformStep.applicantSpeakLanguage}}
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-8 mt-16">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">6. A Statement of Expert Evaluation is attached. (Form 17.1A)</div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-8 mt-16">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">7. A list of Next of Kin of Prospective Ward is also attached. (Form 15.0)</div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-8 mt-16">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">8. The whole estate of the Prospective Ward is estimated as follows:</div>
                </div>

                <div class="pl-30 flex v--end h--start gap-4 mt-8">
                  <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4 w-30">
                    <div class="txt txt--s lh-100 w-auto">Personal Property</div>
                    <div class="input dotted fullw"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s lh-100">$</div>
                  <div class="input w-30">{{assetsAndIncomeStep.estimatedValuePersonalProperty}}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="pl-30 flex v--end h--start gap-4 mt-8">
                  <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4 w-30">
                    <div class="txt txt--s lh-100 w-auto">Real Estate</div>
                    <div class="input dotted fullw"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s lh-100">$</div>
                  <div class="input w-30">{{assetsAndIncomeStep.estimatedValueRealEstate}}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="pl-30 flex v--end h--start gap-4 mt-8">
                  <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4 w-30">
                    <div class="txt txt--s lh-100 w-auto">Annual Rents</div>
                    <div class="input dotted fullw"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s lh-100">$</div>
                  <div class="input w-30">{{assetsAndIncomeStep.annualRentsReceived}}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="pl-30 flex v--end h--start gap-4 mt-8">
                  <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4 w-30">
                    <div class="txt txt--s lh-100 w-auto">Other annual income</div>
                    <div class="input dotted fullw"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s lh-100">$</div>
                  <div class="input w-30">{{assetsAndIncomeStep.otherAnnualIncome}}</div>
                </div>


              </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="mt-auto">
            <div class="flex v--center h--center">
              <div class="text--center fw-600 txt txt--xs uppercase">
                FRANKLIN COUNTY FORM G-17.0A - APPLICATION FOR APPOINTMENT OF GUARDIAN OF ALLEGED INCOMPETENT <br>(PAGE 1)
              </div>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <!--page 2-->

    <div class="page">
        <header>
            <div class="flex v--end h--end gap-4 mt-16">
                <div class="txt txt--m uppercase w-auto">
                    <p>CASE NO.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="input w-auto mw-200">{{caseDetailsStep.caseNumber}}</div>
            </div>
        </header>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="grid gap-20">
              <div>
                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-4">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">9.&nbsp;</div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>Applicant offers the attached bond in the amount of (at least twice value of personal property under R.C. 2109.04)</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4 pl-16 mt-8">
                    <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">$</div>
                    <div class="input mw-300">{{assetsAndIncomeStep.bondAmount}}</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex gap-4 v--start h--start">
                <div class="txt txt--s">10.</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s">
                  <p>Applicant represents that Applicant is not an administrator, executor or fiduciary of an estate wherein the Prospective Ward is interested.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex gap-4 v--start h--start">
                <div class="txt txt--s">11.</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s">
                  <p>Applicant represents that a guardian of the Prospective Ward is necessary in order that 
                    <span class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals guardianshipTypeStep.guardianResponsibility "Personal and medical needs"}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</span>
                  the Prospective Ward's person 
                  <span class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals guardianshipTypeStep.guardianResponsibility "Financial decisions and managing money and property"}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</span>
                  the Prospective Ward's property may be taken proper care of, and asks that a guardian be appointed.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="flex gap-4 v--start h--start">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">12.</div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>TYPE OF GUARDIANSHIP APPLIED FOR IS: (Check the applicable boxes)</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid col-5 gap-8 mt-16 pl-20">
                  <div class="col flex v--center h--start gap-4">
                    <div class="checkbox">{{#includes guardianshipTypeStep.typeGuardianship "Person and estate"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--s">
                      Person and Estate
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col flex v--center h--start gap-4">
                    <div class="checkbox">{{#includes guardianshipTypeStep.typeGuardianship "Person only"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--s">
                      Estate Only
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col flex v--center h--start gap-4">
                    <div class="checkbox">{{#includes guardianshipTypeStep.typeGuardianship "Estate only"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--s">
                      Person Only
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid col-5 gap-8 mt-16 pl-20">
                  <div class="col flex v--center h--start gap-4">
                    <div class="checkbox">{{#includes guardianshipTypeStep.typeGuardianship "Non-limited"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--s">
                      Non-Limited
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col flex v--center h--start gap-4">
                    <div class="checkbox">{{#includes guardianshipTypeStep.typeGuardianship "Limited"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--s">
                      Limited
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col flex v--center h--start gap-4">
                    <div class="checkbox">{{#includes guardianshipTypeStep.typeGuardianship "Interim"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--s">
                      Interim
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col flex v--center h--start gap-4">
                    <div class="checkbox">{{#includes guardianshipTypeStep.typeGuardianship "Emergency"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                    <div class="txt txt--s">
                      Emergency
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <div class="flex gap-4 v--start h--start">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto lh-140">13.</div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto lh-140">
                    <p>If limited guardianship is applied for, the limited powers requested are:</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="input fullw"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="pl-20">
                  {{#if guardianshipTypeStep.limitedPowersRequested}}
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8">{{guardianshipTypeStep.limitedPowersRequested}}</div>
                  {{else}}
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                  {{/if}}
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <div class="flex gap-4 v--start h--start">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">14.</div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>The time period requested is <span class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals guardianshipTypeStep.timePeriodRequested "Indefinite"}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</span>indefinite, or <span class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals guardianshipTypeStep.timePeriodRequested "Limited to a specific time period"}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</span>limited to the following specific time period:</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="pl-20">
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <div class="flex gap-4 v--start h--start">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">15.</div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>Applicant 
                    <span class="checkbox">{{#if legalDeclarationsStep.isApplicantHasBeenChargedWithViolence}}✓{{/if}}</span>has 
                    <span class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals legalDeclarationsStep.isApplicantHasBeenChargedWithViolence false}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</span>
                    has not been charged with, or convicted of, a crime involving theft, physical violence, sexual abuse, alcohol abuse, or substance abuse. If the Applicant has been charged, or convicted, list the date and place of each charge and each conviction:</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="pl-20 mt-20">
                  <div class="flex v--start h--between">
                    <div class="w-20"><div class="txt txt--s">Charge/Conviction</div></div>
                    <div class="w-30"><div class="txt txt--s">Date</div></div>
                    <div class="w-50"><div class="txt txt--s">Place</div></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex mt-8 v--start h--between">
                    <div class="w-20"><div class="input fullw">{{legalDeclarationsStep.conviction.convictionName}}</div></div>
                    <div class="w-30"><div class="input fullw">{{legalDeclarationsStep.conviction.convictionDate}}</div></div>
                    <div class="w-50"><div class="input fullw">{{legalDeclarationsStep.conviction.convictionPlace}}</div></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex mt-8 v--start h--between">
                    <div class="w-20"><div class="input fullw"></div></div>
                    <div class="w-30"><div class="input fullw"></div></div>
                    <div class="w-50"><div class="input fullw"></div></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex mt-8 v--start h--between">
                    <div class="w-20"><div class="input fullw"></div></div>
                    <div class="w-30"><div class="input fullw"></div></div>
                    <div class="w-50"><div class="input fullw"></div></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <div class="flex gap-4 v--start h--start">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">16.</div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>
                      <span class="checkbox">{{#if wardInformStep.isWardHasMilitaryService}}✓{{/if}}</span>
                      Applicant represents that the Prospective Ward had military service:</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="pl-30 mt-16 ml-20">
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start w-55 gap-4">
                    <div class="txt txt--s lh-140 w-auto">Military ID:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{wardInformStep.militaryService.militaryId}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start w-55 gap-4 mt-10">
                    <div class="txt txt--s lh-140 w-auto">Branch of Service:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{wardInformStep.militaryService.branchService}}</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex v--start h--start w-55 gap-4 mt-10">
                    <div class="txt txt--s lh-140 w-auto">Dates of Services:</div>
                    <div class="input fullw">{{wardInformStep.militaryService.startDateOfService}} - {{wardInformStep.militaryService.endDateOfService}}</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="mt-auto">
            <div class="flex v--center h--center">
              <div class="text--center fw-600 txt txt--xs uppercase">
                FRANKLIN COUNTY FORM G-17.0A - APPLICATION FOR APPOINTMENT OF GUARDIAN OF ALLEGED INCOMPETENT <br>(PAGE 2)
              </div>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <!--page 3-->

    <div class="page">
        <header>
            <div class="flex v--end h--end gap-4 mt-16">
                <div class="txt txt--m uppercase w-auto">
                    <p>CASE NO.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="input w-auto mw-200">{{caseDetailsStep.caseNumber}}</div>
            </div>
        </header>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="grid gap-20">
              <div>
                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-4">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">17. </div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>To the best of your ability, list the Prospective Ward's prescription and over-the-counter medications:</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="pl-20">
                  {{#if wardInformStep.wardPrescriptions}}
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8">{{wardInformStep.wardPrescriptions}}</div>
                  {{else}}
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8"></div>
                  {{/if}}
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-4">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">18. </div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>To the best of your ability, list all public and/or private assistance the Prospective Ward receives (Ex: Medicaid,</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="pl-20 flex v--start h--start gap-4 mt-8">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">
                    Medicare, private insurance, SSDI, etc.):
                  </div>
                  <div class="input fullw"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="pl-20">
                  <div class="input fullw mt-8">{{assetsAndIncomeStep.publicPrivateAssistance}}</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-4">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">19. </div>
                  <div class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals assetsAndIncomeStep.isWardHasRepresentativePayee true}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>Applicant represents that the Prospective Ward has a representative payee. List representative payee</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="pl-20 flex v--start h--start gap-4 mt-8">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">
                    information:
                  </div>
                  <div class="input fullw">{{assetsAndIncomeStep.payeeName}}, {{assetsAndIncomeStep.payeeAddress}}</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div>
                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-4">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">20. </div>
                  <div class="checkbox">{{#if legalDeclarationsStep.isGuardianHasBeenNominatedInWriting}}✓{{/if}}</div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>Applicant represents that a guardian has been nominated in writing, in a Will, or in a Power of Attorney. The</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="pl-20 flex v--start h--start gap-4 mt-8">
                  <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">
                    nominated person is:
                  </div>
                  <div class="input fullw">{{legalDeclarationsStep.nominatedPersonName}}</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-4">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">21. </div>
                  <div class="checkbox">{{#if legalDeclarationsStep.isNominatedPersonContactInfoListedOnForm15}}✓{{/if}}</div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>The nominated person's contact information is listed on Form 15.0 - Next of Kin.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-4">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">22. </div>
                  <div class="checkbox">{{#if legalDeclarationsStep.isGuardianNominatedDocumentAttached}}✓{{/if}}</div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s">
                    <p>A copy of the document which nominates the guardian is attached.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-4">
                  <div class="txt txt--s">23. </div>
                  <div class="txt txt--s lh-140">
                    <p><span class="checkbox ml-0">{{#if legalDeclarationsStep.isApplicantAgreed}}✓{{/if}}</span>Applicant represents that the address provided below is the Applicant's permanent address and acknowledges the requirement that the Court be notified of any change of address. Removal may result from failure to comply with this requirement.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="mt-100 grid col-2 gap-20">
                <div class="col grid gap-16">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw"></div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs">Attorney for Applicant’s Signature </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw"></div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs">Typed or Printed Name </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw"></div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs">Address</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw"></div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs">City, State, Zip Code </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw"></div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs">Telephone Number (include area code) </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw"></div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs">Attorney’s Registration No.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col grid gap-16">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw"></div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs">Applicant’s Signature</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw">{{applicantInformStep.applicantName}}</div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs">Typed or Printed Name</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw">{{applicantInformStep.applicantAddress}}</div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs">Address</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw"></div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs">City, State, Zip Code</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw">{{applicantInformStep.applicantPhone}}</div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs">Telephone Number (include area code)</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw">{{applicantInformStep.applicantEmail}}</div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs">Applicant E-mail</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="mt-auto">
            <div class="flex v--center h--center">
              <div class="text--center fw-600 txt txt--xs uppercase">
                FRANKLIN COUNTY FORM G-17.0A - APPLICATION FOR APPOINTMENT OF GUARDIAN OF ALLEGED INCOMPETENT <br>(PAGE 3)
              </div>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>
